// Auth0.xcconfig
// Auth0 tenant configuration — REAL provisioned tenant (public identifiers;
// the domain and client ID are not secrets and are safe to commit, per
// SECRETS.md's Auth0 section). Injected into Info.plist via project.yml so
// Auth0AuthProvider reads them at runtime; never hardcoded in Swift.
//
// If these are ever reverted to placeholder values (e.g. a stripped-down
// fork), Auth0Config.fromInfoPlist detects the placeholder shape and the
// app degrades to the local dev sign-in fallback (DevSignInAuthProvider)
// instead of attempting a doomed network call.
//
// The Auth0 application must allow the macOS callback URL documented in
// SECRETS.md (Auth0.swift format:
//   {bundleID}://{domain}/macos/{bundleID}/callback).
// After changing values here, re-run `xcodegen generate`.

AUTH0_DOMAIN = dev-jrm7z08z1lx4u3pg.us.auth0.com
AUTH0_CLIENT_ID = jvCvc5uGUuTJjirvZMI7RAl7A3wrduYj
